thletes/81587"} "Galina Kulakova"] ", who had won three gold medals in 1972, originally placed third but was disqualified when doping control revealed traces of ephedrine, which were reportedly from a nasal spray. It was the first doping positive in Olympic cross-country skiing, but far from the last."] "\n\n"] "\n\n" [:h2 {} "Events"] "\n" [:table {:class "table table-striped"} "\n" [:thead {} "\n" [:tr {} "\n" [:th {} "Event"] "\n" [:th {} "Status"] "\n" [:th {} "Date"] "\n" [:th {} "Participants"] "\n" [:th {} "NOCs"] "\n"] "\n"] "\n" [:tbody {} [:tr {} "\n" [:td {} [:a {:href "/results/1972"} "15 kilometres, Men"]] "\n" [:td {} "Olympic"] "\n" [:td {} " 8 February 1976"] "\n" [:td {} "80"] "\n" [:td {} "23"] "\n"] "\n" [:tr {} "\n" [:td {} [:a {:href "/results/1973"} "30 kilometres, Men"]] "\n" [:td {} "Olympic"] "\n" [:td {} " 5 February 1976"] "\n" [:td {} "69"] "\n" [:td {} "21"] "\n"] "\n" [:tr {} "\n" [:td {} [:a {:href "/results/1974"} "50 kilometres, Men"]] "\n" [:td {} "Olympic"] "\n" [:td {} "14 February 1976"] "\n" [:td {} "59"] "\n" [:td {} "17"] "\n"] "\n" [:tr {} "\n" [:td {} [:a {:href "/results/1975"} "4 × 10 kilometres Relay, Men"]] "\n" [:td {} "Olympic"] "\n" [:td {} "11 February 1976"] "\n" [:td {} "64"] "\n" [:td {} "16"] "\n"] "\n" [:tr {} "\n" [:td {} [:a {:href "/results/1979"} "5 kilometres, Women"]] "\n" [:td {} "Olympic"] "\n" [:td {} " 7 February 1976"] "\n" [:td {} "44"] "\n" [:td {} "14"] "\n"] "\n" [:tr {} "\n" [:td {} [:a {:href "/results/1980"} "10 kilometres, Women"]] "\n" [:td {} "Olympic"] "\n" [:td {} "10 February 1976"] "\n" [:td {} "44"] "\n" [:td {} "14"] "\n"] "\n" [:tr {} "\n" [:td {} [:a {:href "/results/1981"} "4 × 5 kilometres Relay, Women"]] "\n" [:td {} "Olympic"] "\n" [:td {} "12 February 1976"] "\n" [:td {} "36"] "\n" [:td {} "9"] "\n"] "\n" [:tr {} "\n" [:td {}] "\n" [:td {}] "\n" [:td {}] "\n" [:td {:class "border-top"} "\n165 (114/51)\n"] "\n" [:td {:class "border-top"} "\n24 (23/14)\n"] "\n"] "\n"]] "\n\n\n" [: